{% if t.name.startswith("Session conversion: weekend") %}
  Weekend sessions convert at {{ t.details.p_b | pct(2) }} vs {{ t.details.p_a | pct(2) }} on weekdays
  ({{ t.details.relative_lift | spct }} relative). Caveat: sessions of one user are correlated, so the
  z-test's independence assumption holds only approximately.
{% elif t.name.startswith("Order value") %}
