{% elif t.name.startswith("Session duration") %}
  Buyers' sessions are longer (median {{ t.details.median_b | num }} s vs {{ t.details.median_a | num }} s);
  durations are heavily skewed, hence the Mann-Whitney U test rather than a t-test.
{% elif t.name.startswith("Product price") %}
  Across {{ t.details.n_products | num }} products, pricier items convert less often (a monotonic,
  not necessarily linear, relationship - hence Spearman).
