## 5. Propensity model

**Task.** Predict whether a user purchases in the next {{ cfg.labels.label_days }} days from
their behaviour in the previous {{ cfg.labels.feature_days }} days. Snapshots are time-based to
avoid leakage: train cutoff {{ cfg.labels.splits.train }}, validation {{ cfg.labels.splits.valid }},
test {{ cfg.labels.splits.test }}. Features only see events strictly before the cutoff and labels
only the window after it; `tests/test_labels.py` asserts that features computed on the full
history equal those computed on history truncated at the cutoff.

